    "provPage.faq.title": "Frequently asked questions",
    "provPage.faq.q1": "Is Ruumly free for partners to use?",
    "provPage.faq.q1.a": "Yes. Ruumly is free for partners: add your company, locations, and listings without monthly fees.",
    "provPage.faq.q2": "Do I have to enable online bookings and payments?",
    "provPage.faq.q2.a": "No. You can start with a public profile and requests only. Booking, contract signing, and payment flows can be enabled later from partner or admin settings if you want them.",
    "provPage.faq.q3": "What paid options may come later?",
    "provPage.faq.q3.a": "Examples include search boosts, homepage featured placement, blog or social campaigns, calendar/import help, analytics, or contract workflows. They are optional and activated only by agreement.",
    "provPage.faq.q4": "What does Ruumly actually do for me?",
    "provPage.faq.q4.a": "We handle the parts of your business that aren't delivering the service: SEO, Google Ads, content marketing, social media, PR — and qualifying enquiries. We bring interested customers to you so you don't spend time on marketing. You focus on the work.",
    "provPage.faq.q5": "Can I cancel any time?",
    "provPage.faq.q5.a": "Yes. If you no longer want to be visible on Ruumly, your listings can be paused. No paid obligation is added without a separate agreement.",
