    "faq.title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "faq.subtitle": "Answers to the most common questions: how requests work, how fast offers arrive, what's free, and how partners join Ruumly.",
    "faq.general": "General",
    "faq.bookings": "Booking & payment",
    "faq.contractCat": "Contract & cancellation",
    "faq.providers": "For partners",
    "faq.whatIsRuumly": "What is Ruumly?",
    "faq.whatIsRuumlyA": "Ruumly is Estonia's platform for moving and space services. The simplest way to use it: send one request and we'll find you 2–3 offers from verified partners. Prefer to choose yourself? Browse the partner directory on the map — storage, moving, trailers and more.",
    "faq.whatStorage": "What can I find on Ruumly?",
    "faq.whatStorageA": "Seven things: moving services (movers with a van), storage (storage units, mini-warehouses and warehouse space), trailer rental, van rental, packing services and moving boxes, move-out cleaning, and insurance. Ask for any of them with one request, or browse each directory separately.",
    "faq.isFree": "Is Ruumly free for customers to use?",
    "faq.isFreeA": "Yes. Searching, comparing, and sending requests is free for users. You only pay the selected partner for storage or services.",
    "faq.whichCities": "Which areas are covered?",
    "faq.whichCitiesA": "The directory covers all of Estonia — Tallinn, Tartu, Pärnu, Narva and beyond. The full service (request → offers) currently operates in Tallinn and Harjumaa; elsewhere in Estonia you can find partners in the directory and contact them directly.",
    "faq.conciergeHow": "How does Ruumly work?",
    "faq.conciergeHowA": "Fill in a short request — what you need, where and when. We review it, pick verified partners and send you 2–3 fitting offers. You compare, choose, and agree the details directly with the partner. No ring-around, no filling in quote forms on ten different sites.",
    "faq.offerSpeed": "How fast do the offers arrive?",
    "faq.offerSpeedA": "Usually within 24 hours. Most requests receive 2–3 offers; if your need is very specific or few partners cover your area, we'll tell you honestly and suggest a next step.",
    "faq.oneRequest": "Which services can I ask for with one request?",
    "faq.oneRequestA": "Everything a move involves: moving services, storage, trailer rental, van rental, packing help and moving boxes, move-out cleaning, and insurance. Tick everything you need in the request — we'll send offers for each service, and you never have to repeat your story.",
    "faq.freeService": "Is the service free?",
    "faq.freeServiceA": "Yes, completely free for customers. Ruumly adds no commission — you pay only your chosen partner the price in their offer. Listing is free for partners too (0% commission); optional paid visibility boosts never affect your price.",
    "faq.claimProfile": "What is a catalog profile and how do I claim mine?",
    "faq.claimProfileA": "The Ruumly directory lists moving, storage and rental providers across Estonia. Some profiles were created from public data so customers can see the whole market on one map. If it's your business, you can claim the profile for free: click “Claim this profile” on the page or write to us, we verify your connection to the company, and from then on you manage your own details, prices and enquiries. Claiming is free, commission is 0%, and approved partners receive the verified-partner badge.",
    "faq.howToBook": "How do I book or get in touch?",
    "faq.howToBookA": "Search and open a listing, then it depends on the partner. Some let you book online right away — enter your details, pay securely, and sign a digital contract. Others are request-first: you send a request or ask for a quote (typical for moving), and the partner contacts you to arrange the details. You always see which option a listing offers before you commit.",
    "faq.isSecure": "Is payment secure?",
    "faq.isSecureA": "At launch, payments are made by bank transfer to Ruumly's account using the reference shown at checkout; we confirm and notify you once it arrives. Card payment is enabled per partner where available — you only ever see the methods a partner actually offers.",
    "faq.isCheaper": "How do prices work?",
    "faq.isCheaperA": "Prices are set by each partner. Ruumly helps you compare them in one place; if a partner offers a special price or discount, it appears on that listing.",
    "faq.whatFees": "Are there any extra fees?",
    "faq.whatFeesA": "Ruumly does not add a customer service fee. If a partner enables online booking or payment, you see the final price before confirming.",
    "faq.howFast": "How fast is booking confirmed?",
    "faq.howFastA": "For requests, offers usually arrive within 24 hours. For listings with online booking, your booking is confirmed instantly once payment and any contract are completed, and you get an email confirmation with access details. For request-first listings, the partner replies directly — usually within a day.",
    "faq.digitalContract": "What is the digital rental contract?",
    "faq.digitalContractA": "Where a partner uses contracts, a rental agreement can be concluded online with a self-declared acknowledgment (a drawn or typed signature) — not a qualified eIDAS signature. The standard template currently covers storage rentals and isn't required for every booking.",
    "faq.howSign": "How do I sign the contract?",
    "faq.howSignA": "You sign online through a secure digital signing service right after payment. It only takes a moment, and a signed copy is sent to your email.",
    "faq.canCancel": "Can I cancel a booking?",
    "faq.canCancelA": "Yes. You can cancel free of charge within 24 hours of booking and receive a full refund. After that, the partner's cancellation terms apply — these are always shown before you book.",
    "faq.howToJoin": "How can I become a partner?",
    "faq.howToJoinA": "Go to the 'For partners' page, fill in the registration form, and add your location. You can add multiple unit types per location — for example different sizes or price tiers. Our team will contact you within 48 hours.",
    "faq.howPaid": "How do partners get paid?",
    "faq.howPaidA": "In most cases the customer pays the partner directly according to the partner's terms. If the partner enables Ruumly online booking and payment, that flow is shown before confirmation and settlement follows the partner settings.",
    "faq.joinCost": "What does it cost to join?",
    "faq.joinCostA": "Joining and adding listings is free. Optional visibility boosts or tools may be offered later and are always opt-in by agreement.",
    "faq.canEditPrices": "Can I manage my own prices?",
    "faq.canEditPricesA": "Yes, partners can manage their prices, availability, and listing descriptions.",
    "faq.noAnswer": "Didn't find your answer?",
    "faq.noAnswerDesc": "Our team is happy to help — get in touch and we'll reply quickly.",
    "faq.seeHow": "See how it works",
    "faq.contactUs": "Contact us",

    "homeFaq.q1": "How does Ruumly work?",
    "homeFaq.a1": "Search for storage, compare locations and prices, then contact the partner. If the partner enables online booking, you can also confirm dates and terms right away.",
    "homeFaq.q2": "Do I have to book online?",
    "homeFaq.a2": "No. Many listings start with a request or direct contact with the partner. Online booking, contract signing, and payment appear only where the partner has enabled them.",
    "homeFaq.q3": "How do I become a partner?",
    "homeFaq.a3": "If you're a service provider, fill out the form on 'For partners'. We'll get back to you within 48h.",
    "homeFaq.q4": "Can I cancel a booking?",
    "homeFaq.a4": "Cancellation terms depend on the provider and are always visible before booking.",

