    "hiw.title": "How Ruumly works",
    "hiw.subtitle": "One request, 2–3 offers, zero ring-around. Here's how it works.",
    "hiw.heroSearch": "Search",
    "hiw.heroList": "List your space",
    "hiw.stepsTitle": "Your journey in five steps",
    "hiw.stepsSubtitle": "You tell us what you need. We find the providers.",
    "hiw.step1": "Search & compare verified storage near you",
    "hiw.step1desc": "Enter your location and browse storage and warehouse units from verified partners. Compare size, price, and access terms on the map or in a list.",
    "hiw.step2": "We find the partners",
    "hiw.step2desc": "We review your request and pick verified partners who actually fit — not just everyone on the list.",
    "hiw.step3": "You get 2–3 offers",
    "hiw.step3desc": "Usually within 24 hours the offers are in your inbox. Compare prices and terms at your own pace.",
    "hiw.step4": "Choose and confirm",
    "hiw.step4desc": "Deal with your chosen partner directly and agree the details. Ruumly is free for customers and adds nothing to the price.",
    "hiw.step5": "Get access & move in",
    "hiw.step5desc": "Receive confirmation and access instructions from the partner — bring your belongings and move in on your chosen date.",
    "hiw.whyTitle": "Why trust Ruumly?",
    "hiw.whySubtitle": "Clarity at every step — before you commit to anything.",
    "hiw.feat1": "Verified partners",
    "hiw.feat1desc": "Every space comes from a verified partner, rated by real customers.",
    "hiw.feat2": "Real offers, not ads",
    "hiw.feat2desc": "Offers come from partners who have read your request. We don't sell your contact details to ten companies.",
    "hiw.feat3": "Clear terms",
    "hiw.feat3desc": "Listings, requests, and optional rental agreements keep size, price, and access details in one view.",
    "hiw.feat4": "Partner-managed availability",
    "hiw.feat4desc": "Partners manage availability, calendars, and access details so public information stays current.",
    "hiw.partnerBadge": "For partners",
    "hiw.partnerTitle": "List your space on Ruumly",
    "hiw.partnerDesc": "Have spare storage or warehouse space? List it on Ruumly for free and reach customers searching on maps and Google. You set prices, availability, and whether you want requests only or online booking too.",
    "hiw.partnerBullet1": "Manage your prices, availability, and listings yourself",
